            "displayName": "Compact CLI system prompt testtttt",
            "description": "Run an A/B experiment in Copilot CLI to evaluate a compact system prompt. The current prompt repeats guidance across system sections, model-specific tuning, tool descriptions/schemas, and SQL/skill instructions, adding about 2,000-2,400 static tokens per request depending on model. Treatment enables copilot_cli_compact_system_prompt and replaces those redundant sections with compact versions while preserving key behavioral constraints; control remains the current prompt and must stay byte-identical when the flag is off. ",
